{"about_the_game":"<strong>What\u2019s that?</strong> You want to return home and see your friends and family again? Hahaha. <br>Don\u2019t you get it?<strong> You've no-clipped into the Backrooms. </strong>There is no escape! You should start getting used to living here for the rest of your life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/968200baf184032852ace93f793190ec.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/968200baf184032852ace93f793190ec.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/968200baf184032852ace93f793190ec.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2>I've been told that every level is different - the Backrooms is constantly changing, so who knows what you'll find out there! That means you'll never be able to memorize what's coming next. Every journey will be different from the last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d4dd398fd3d2b3fd43275abe91edbd06.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d4dd398fd3d2b3fd43275abe91edbd06.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d4dd398fd3d2b3fd43275abe91edbd06.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2>There are a lot of things out there trying to kill us. <br>My advice?<br><br>Run.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/a87f51484850b9d12e2b85d4206902b8.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/a87f51484850b9d12e2b85d4206902b8.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/a87f51484850b9d12e2b85d4206902b8.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOOLS</h2>Its dangerous to go alone! Take this ancient smart phone. Use it to take neat pictures or text your friends! It can do a lot of other stuff too but... who really cares? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5dc8d44c6a4a72226aa7bf9687d308c0.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5dc8d44c6a4a72226aa7bf9687d308c0.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5dc8d44c6a4a72226aa7bf9687d308c0.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES</h2>To unlock the exits we need to solve Puzzles. Good thing you're good at puzzles, right? <br><br>Right???!!!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d16764a85096644d0d5eae2b797aeba5.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d16764a85096644d0d5eae2b797aeba5.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d16764a85096644d0d5eae2b797aeba5.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK TOGETHER</h2>So, despite everything I've conveyed to you, you are still set on trying to escape? Very well, I'll join you. Our odds are better if we work together. I promise - you can trust me. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5bc4709253ca72a19c3c5c33bf3f40a0.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5bc4709253ca72a19c3c5c33bf3f40a0.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5bc4709253ca72a19c3c5c33bf3f40a0.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2562390?t=1770232023","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2562390?t=1770232023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770232023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770232023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>What\u2019s that?</strong> You want to return home and see your friends and family again? Hahaha. <br>Don\u2019t you get it?<strong> You've no-clipped into the Backrooms. </strong>There is no escape! You should start getting used to living here for the rest of your life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/968200baf184032852ace93f793190ec.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/968200baf184032852ace93f793190ec.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/968200baf184032852ace93f793190ec.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2>I've been told that every level is different - the Backrooms is constantly changing, so who knows what you'll find out there! That means you'll never be able to memorize what's coming next. Every journey will be different from the last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d4dd398fd3d2b3fd43275abe91edbd06.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d4dd398fd3d2b3fd43275abe91edbd06.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d4dd398fd3d2b3fd43275abe91edbd06.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2>There are a lot of things out there trying to kill us. <br>My advice?<br><br>Run.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/a87f51484850b9d12e2b85d4206902b8.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/a87f51484850b9d12e2b85d4206902b8.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/a87f51484850b9d12e2b85d4206902b8.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOOLS</h2>Its dangerous to go alone! Take this ancient smart phone. Use it to take neat pictures or text your friends! It can do a lot of other stuff too but... who really cares? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5dc8d44c6a4a72226aa7bf9687d308c0.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5dc8d44c6a4a72226aa7bf9687d308c0.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5dc8d44c6a4a72226aa7bf9687d308c0.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES</h2>To unlock the exits we need to solve Puzzles. Good thing you're good at puzzles, right? <br><br>Right???!!!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d16764a85096644d0d5eae2b797aeba5.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d16764a85096644d0d5eae2b797aeba5.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/d16764a85096644d0d5eae2b797aeba5.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK TOGETHER</h2>So, despite everything I've conveyed to you, you are still set on trying to escape? Very well, I'll join you. Our odds are better if we work together. I promise - you can trust me. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5bc4709253ca72a19c3c5c33bf3f40a0.poster.avif?t=1770232023\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5bc4709253ca72a19c3c5c33bf3f40a0.webm?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/extras/5bc4709253ca72a19c3c5c33bf3f40a0.mp4?t=1770232023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["GameName"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562390/header.jpg?t=1770232023","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Benny's Backrooms characters and content are Copyright 2022 - GameName LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> </li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional N